  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Inclusive &amp; Sustainable Jobs Creation Law Implementation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project Towards Sustainable &amp; Inclusive Natural Resources Management under Jobs Creation Law is intended to provide technical assistance in the development of implementing regulations of the Jobs Creation Law in the environment and forestry sector. The Partnership for Governance Reform (Kemitraan),  an Indonesian non governmental organization will work together with Global Green Growth Institute (GGGI) in helping the Ministry of Environment and Forestry develop norms, standards, procedures and guidelines to implement the law and work with sub national governments to ensure that Environmental and Social Safeguards (ESS) are reflected in policies and development planning documents.</narrative>
  </description>
